OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1785610080
OL,3,CSinn Fein sounds warning over future
OL,4,Cof powersharing amid 'DUP behaviour'
OL,6,FSinn Fein has sounded a warning on the
OL,7,Ffuture of powersharing in Northern
OL,8,FIreland, claiming the "behaviour of
OL,9,Fthe DUP" is "frustrating" delivery.
OL,11,FSenator Conor Murphy claimed
OL,12,Fpowersharing is in a "precarious
OL,13,Fplace", and that the DUP "don't have
OL,14,Fthe political will to make it work".
OL,16,FHe insisted his party is "wedded to
OL,17,Fpowersharing", but that the DUP "is
OL,18,Fthere because they have to be there".
OL,26,@kD@GrrnD@GrrpD@WOUqD@HO]qD@MOUqD@YO]tD@
OL,26,AVOUuD@FO]uD@ZOUvD@cO]xD@ZOUyD@MO]yD@aOU
OL,26,BzD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1785610080
OL,3,CSinn Fein sounds warning over future
OL,4,Cof powersharing amid 'DUP behaviour'
OL,6,F"The DUP have demonstrated that they
OL,7,Fdon't have a political will to make
OL,8,Fthe Assembly work and that poses
OL,9,Fbigger questions for powersharing ...
OL,10,Fthe institutions are in a precarious
OL,11,Fplace," he said.
OL,13,FDUP leader Gavin Robinson hit back
OL,14,Fsaying he and his colleagues are
OL,15,F"committed to not only the
OL,16,Finstitutions but delivering for the
OL,17,Fpeople we are proud to represent".
OL,26,@kD@GrrnD@AOUsD@GO]wD@AOUyD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1785610080
OL,3,CSinn Fein sounds warning over future
OL,4,Cof powersharing amid 'DUP behaviour'
OL,6,F"We don't shy away from the
OL,7,Fchallenges, and nor will we be goaded
OL,8,Fby that sort of commentary, we're here
OL,9,Ftoday and we're here every day willing
OL,10,Fto step up and stand up for the people
OL,11,Fof Northern Ireland," he said.
OL,13,FAlliance leader Naomi Long urged all
OL,14,Fsides to "take a step back, take a
OL,15,Fdeep breath and recognise elections
OL,16,Fwill come and go, and we will still
OL,17,Fhave to do business with each other,
OL,18,Fbut focus for the next nine months on
OL,19,Fwhat we can actually achieve".
OL,26,@kD@GrrnD@AOUsD@UO]vD@JOU{D@]O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1785610080
OL,3,CSinn Fein sounds warning over future
OL,4,Cof powersharing amid 'DUP behaviour'
OL,6,FThe statements came as parties visited
OL,7,FHillsborough Castle for meetings with
OL,8,Fthe new Secretary of State Sir Chris
OL,9,FBryant.
OL,11,FSir Chris arrived in the region for
OL,12,Fhis first official visit in post on
OL,13,FFriday, and visited defence systems
OL,14,Fplant Thales in east Belfast ahead of
OL,15,Fmeeting the Stormont parties later.
OL,17,FSpeaking about his new role, Sir Chris
OL,18,Fsaid he is looking forward to the
OL,19,Fchallenge and said he can be "an
OL,20,Fhonest and fair broker between people
OL,21,Fwho don't agree on everything".
OL,26,@kD@Grr{D@^OU}D@^O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1785610080
OL,3,CSinn Fein sounds warning over future
OL,4,Cof powersharing amid 'DUP behaviour'
OL,6,FHowever he said he was "nervous" about
OL,7,Fthe prospect of "walking on
OL,8,Feggshells", speaking in Belfast: "I
OL,9,Fthink if everybody spends all their
OL,10,Ftime wondering about whether an
OL,11,Findividual politician is going to say
OL,12,Fthe right thing or put it in the right
OL,13,Fway, then we've all lost."
OL,15,F"I think being able to accept that
OL,16,Fwe're all working in good faith
OL,17,Ftowards the same ends, namely economic
OL,18,Fprosperity and a degree of community
OL,19,Fharmony, then I think that that
OL,20,Fachieves far more," he added.
OL,26,@kD@GrrnD@XOUnD@`O]oD@QOUpD@JO]pD@bOUuD@
OL,26,AZO]wD@AOU|D@SO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
