OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1785610080
OL,3,CSinn Fein sounds warning over future
OL,4,Cof powersharing amid 'DUP behaviour'
OL,6,FAs Stormont ministers have been unable
OL,7,Fto agree a budget for the current
OL,8,Ffinancial year, with departments
OL,9,Foperating on contingency budgets since
OL,10,FApril, Sir Chris expressed his
OL,11,Fdetermination to "keep the show on the
OL,12,Froad".
OL,14,FMinisters across the four-party
OL,15,FExecutive have consistently made the
OL,16,Fpoint that they need more money from
OL,17,Fthe Treasury to address a funding
OL,18,Fcrisis facing public services in the
OL,19,Fregion.
OL,26,@kD@GrrsD@ROUtD@EO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1785610080
OL,3,CSinn Fein sounds warning over future
OL,4,Cof powersharing amid 'DUP behaviour'
OL,6,FFrom Saturday, just 95% of last year's
OL,7,Ffunding will be available to spend
OL,8,Fafter the Executive passes a deadline
OL,9,Fto agree a budget under public finance
OL,10,Flaws.
OL,12,FStormont Opposition leader Matthew
OL,13,FO'Toole had sounded alarms about this
OL,14,Fdeadline, pressing Executive ministers
OL,15,Fto act to avoid facing this effective
OL,16,Ffunding cut.
OL,18,FEarlier Stormont Finance Minister John
OL,19,FO'Dowd said it is "decision time" for
OL,20,Fthe UK Government to properly fund
OL,21,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,26,@kD@Grr{D@SOU{D@aO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1785610080
OL,3,CSinn Fein sounds warning over future
OL,4,Cof powersharing amid 'DUP behaviour'
OL,6,FMr O'Dowd said while Sir Chris and
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey have recently
OL,8,Fcome into post, their officials are
OL,9,Faware of the issues in the region.
OL,11,FResponding to those comments, Sir
OL,12,FChris said he is not expecting any
OL,13,Fdecisions to be made today around the
OL,14,FStormont budget.
OL,16,FHe was speaking ahead of meeting the
OL,17,FStormont parties while agreement on a
OL,18,Fbudget remains outstanding, with calls
OL,19,Ffor further funding for the
OL,20,Fadministration.
OL,26,@kD@Grr
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1785610080
OL,3,CSinn Fein sounds warning over future
OL,4,Cof powersharing amid 'DUP behaviour'
OL,6,FSpeaking in Belfast, Sir Chris said he
OL,7,Fwill be in "listening mode".
OL,9,F"I am not expecting us to be making
OL,10,Fdecisions today, I am in very much
OL,11,Flistening mode. We have two ears and
OL,12,Fone mouth for good reason," he said.
OL,14,F"Quite a few politicians from Northern
OL,15,FIreland have already raised with me:
OL,16,F'Are you coming with a cheque book?'
OL,17,FAnd actually I am coming with a bit of
OL,18,Fa check list of things I want to get
OL,19,Fsorted and done. One of those is of
OL,20,Fcourse we have to get to a situation
OL,21,Fwhere we can have a proper budget.
OL,26,@kD@GrroD@LOUoD@[O]qD@AOUtD@[O]vD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G9/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1785610080
OL,3,CSinn Fein sounds warning over future
OL,4,Cof powersharing amid 'DUP behaviour'
OL,6,F"But we also need to make sure that
OL,7,Fpublic services in Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fare delivering for people.
OL,10,F"I note some of the issues in the NHS,
OL,11,Fsome of the additional costs that
OL,12,Fthere are in Northern Ireland that
OL,13,Fneed to be looked at.
OL,15,F"I have already had the briefest of
OL,16,Fconversations with the Chief Secretary
OL,17,Fto the Treasury, and I want to pursue
OL,18,Fsome of those conversations so we get
OL,19,Fto a long-lasting settlement.
OL,21,F"I want to keep the show on the road."
OL,26,@kD@GrrnD@AOUrD@AOUwD@AOU}D@AOU}D@fO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G10/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41411
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1785610080
OL,3,CSinn Fein sounds warning over future
OL,4,Cof powersharing amid 'DUP behaviour'
OL,6,FSinn Fein were the first party to meet
OL,7,FSir Chris at Hillsborough Castle,
OL,8,Frepresented by Mr O'Dowd, along with
OL,9,FIrish senator Mr Murphy and Economy
OL,10,FMinister Caoimhe Archibald.
OL,12,FMr Murphy said they raised the
OL,13,Finstability of the Executive and the
OL,14,Fbehaviour of the DUP within the
OL,15,FExecutive.
OL,26,@kD@GrrnD@Grr
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G11/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41412
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1785610080
OL,3,CSinn Fein sounds warning over future
OL,4,Cof powersharing amid 'DUP behaviour'
OL,6,FHe warned of "the challenge that
OL,7,Fpresents not just to delivery", adding
OL,8,Fit is "hugely frustrating for our
OL,9,Fministers", and "also to the prospect
OL,10,Fof powersharing into the future if
OL,11,Fthis type of behaviour continues".
OL,13,F"We also raised the issue of
OL,14,Fconstitutional change, of the unity
OL,15,Freferendum, and he needs to engage
OL,16,Fwith that and to engage with the Irish
OL,17,Fgovernment in relation to planning for
OL,18,Fan orderly transition into a unity
OL,19,Freferendum and constitutional change,"
OL,20,FMr Murphy said.
OL,26,@kD@GrrnD@NOUoD@^O]pD@GOUqD@JO]qD@QOUsD@
OL,26,AaO]uD@AOU{D@fO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G12/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41413
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1785610080
OL,3,CSinn Fein sounds warning over future
OL,4,Cof powersharing amid 'DUP behaviour'
OL,6,FHe added that Mr O'Dowd raised the
OL,7,F"underfunding" of the Stormont
OL,8,FExecutive, and the "challenges that
OL,9,Frepresents to run public services",
OL,10,Fwhile Ms Archibald raised the issue of
OL,11,Flegacy and pressed him to call a
OL,12,Fpublic inquiry into the murder of Sean
OL,13,FBrown.
OL,26,@kD@GrroD@AOUoD@NO]pD@TOUqD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G13/14
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,415,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41414
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1785610080
OL,3,CSinn Fein sounds warning over future
OL,4,Cof powersharing amid 'DUP behaviour'
OL,6,F"It was overall a useful discussion
OL,7,Fand clearly the preliminary discussion
OL,8,F` there is a great need for much more
OL,9,Fsubstantial discussions between both
OL,10,Fgovernments and all of the parties
OL,11,Fhere in the time ahead to address all
OL,12,Fthat range of matters," Mr Murphy
OL,13,Fadded.
